4. AV1 specifications
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AV1 Bitstream & Decoding Process Specification
    https://aomediacodec.github.io/av1-spec/av1-spec.pdf

RTP Payload Format For AV1 (v1.0.0)
    https://aomediacodec.github.io/av1-rtp-spec/v1.0.0.html

Both specifications are published by the Alliance for Open Media and
are reproduced in derived form (parsing logic, syntax structures)
under the AOM specification licensing terms covered by the patent
grant reproduced in the root PATENTS file.

