5. Test vectors
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A curated slice of the libaom AV1 conformance test vectors is
committed under internal/av1/testdata/libaom/. The remote manifest
and the full corpus referenced by `make testvectors-full` live at

    https://storage.googleapis.com/aom-test-data

and are distributed by the Alliance for Open Media under the same
terms as libaom itself.

